  "The OS environment variables templates can read with the Environment Variable tag, {tag}: comma-separated names, or prefixes ending in *. None are allowed until you list them, so a collection from someone else can't send yours anywhere.": "模板可通过环境变量标签 {tag} 读取的操作系统环境变量：以逗号分隔的名称，或以 * 结尾的前缀。在你列出之前不允许读取任何变量，因此他人的集合无法将你的变量发送到任何地方。",
  "The assistant suggests a request from a description, and a commit message from your changes, with a model you choose: one on your computer, or a provider's with your own key.": "助手会使用你选择的模型，根据描述建议请求，并根据你的更改建议提交消息：可以是你计算机上的模型，也可以是使用你自己密钥的服务商模型。",
  "The base address of an OpenAI-compatible API, ending before /chat/completions. Ollama's is http://localhost:11434/v1, LM Studio's http://localhost:1234/v1, OpenAI's https://api.openai.com/v1 and Anthropic's https://api.anthropic.com/v1.": "OpenAI 兼容 API 的基础地址，不包括 /chat/completions。Ollama 的为 http://localhost:11434/v1，LM Studio 的为 http://localhost:1234/v1，OpenAI 的为 https://api.openai.com/v1，Anthropic 的为 https://api.anthropic.com/v1。",
  "The endpoint answered, but lists no models.": "端点已响应，但未列出任何模型。",
  "The endpoint offers {count, plural, one {# model} other {# models}}.": "该端点提供 {count, plural, other {# 个模型}}。",
  "The first release": "首个版本",
  "The first time Insomnium connects to a host, it shows the host key's fingerprint and asks before trusting it, unless your known_hosts has it already.": "Insomnium 首次连接到某个主机时，会显示主机密钥的指纹，并在信任前征求你的同意，除非你的 known_hosts 中已包含该主机。",
  "The host for which this client certificate is valid. Port number is optional and * can be used as a wildcard.": "此客户端证书适用的主机。端口号可选，可使用 * 作为通配符。",
  "The model's name as the endpoint knows it, such as llama3.2 or gpt-4o-mini. List Models fetches the names the endpoint offers.": "端点所识别的模型名称，例如 llama3.2 或 gpt-4o-mini。“列出模型”会获取端点提供的模型名称。",
  "The repository's address: https://, or SSH, such as git@github.com:org/repo.git, which connects with your SSH keys (or, if you choose, with a token over its https:// form). Leave it empty for a repository on this computer only, with commits, branches and history; add an address here later to push it.": "仓库地址：https:// 或 SSH（例如 git@github.com:org/repo.git），后者使用你的 SSH 密钥连接（也可选择通过其 https:// 形式使用令牌连接）。留空则创建仅存在于此计算机上的仓库，同样支持提交、分支和历史记录；之后可在此添加地址以进行推送。",
  "The request failed due to an unhandled error:": "由于未处理的错误，请求失败：",
  "The request it sends is no longer in this collection: choose another.": "它发送的请求已不在此集合中：请另选一个。",
  "The requests after it can use it as {example}, over the environment's variables.": "之后的请求可以用 {example} 使用它，优先于环境变量。",
  "The secrets the Vault, 1Password, AWS, Google Cloud and Azure tags may read, with your credentials on this computer: comma-separated references, or prefixes ending in *, such as vault:secret/data/app, op://Work/*, aws:prod/*, gcp:projects/my-project/secrets/*, azure:my-vault/*. None are allowed until you list them, so a collection from someone else can't send yours anywhere.": "Vault、1Password、AWS、Google Cloud 和 Azure 标签可使用你在此计算机上的凭据读取的机密：以逗号分隔的引用，或以 * 结尾的前缀，例如 vault:secret/data/app、op://Work/*、aws:prod/*、gcp:projects/my-project/secrets/*、azure:my-vault/*。在你列出之前不允许读取任何机密，因此他人的集合无法将你的机密发送到任何地方。",
  "The system keychain could not unlock your saved credentials, so they read as empty. Credentials you enter now are kept only until you quit.": "系统钥匙串无法解锁你保存的凭据，因此它们读取为空。你现在输入的凭据只会保留到退出应用为止。",
  "The system keychain is unavailable, so credentials you enter are kept only until you quit, and not saved to disk.": "系统钥匙串不可用，因此你输入的凭据只会保留到退出应用为止，不会保存到磁盘。",
  "The system's ({language})": "系统语言（{language}）",
  "The variables in this environment are always available, regardless of which sub-environment is active. Useful for storing default or fallback values.": "无论激活的是哪个子环境，此环境中的变量始终可用。适合存储默认值或后备值。",
  "Theirs": "对方的",
  "Themes": "主题",
  "There is no response yet: send a request before it.": "还没有响应：请在它之前发送请求。",
  "There may be an issue with the plugin itself.": "插件本身可能存在问题。",
  "These changed here and in {theirs}. Choose which to keep for each; their other changes, and yours, are merged.": "这些内容在此处和{theirs}中均有更改。请为每一项选择要保留的版本；双方的其他更改都将被合并。",
  "This file is offered first, then the IdentityFile your ~/.ssh/config names for the host, and your SSH agent's copies of them, but none of the agent's other keys. Without a file here: that IdentityFile, then the agent's keys, then ~/.ssh/id_ed25519, id_ecdsa and id_rsa. Host aliases in ~/.ssh/config work as the address's host.": "将首先提供此文件，然后是 ~/.ssh/config 中为该主机指定的 IdentityFile，以及 SSH 代理中它们的副本，但不提供代理中的其他密钥。此处未指定文件时：依次尝试该 IdentityFile、代理中的密钥，最后是 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519、id_ecdsa 和 id_rsa。~/.ssh/config 中的主机别名可用作地址中的主机。",
  "This flow is gone: choose another.": "此流程已不存在：请另选一个。",
