  "When": "时间",
  "When on, Insomnium runs an HTTP+SSE server on 127.0.0.1 for MCP clients such as coding agents: they can list and send your requests, run collections, and add or change requests, folders and environments.": "开启后，Insomnium 会在 127.0.0.1 上运行一个 HTTP+SSE 服务器，供编程智能体等 MCP 客户端使用：它们可以列出和发送你的请求、运行集合，以及添加或更改请求、文件夹和环境。",
  "Where Install Plugin gets packages from: a mirror, or your company's own registry. Installs go through the proxy set in General, as requests do.": "“安装插件”获取软件包的来源：镜像或你公司自己的注册表。与请求一样，安装会通过“常规”中设置的代理进行。",
  "Where the flow begins": "流程开始的地方",
  "While it runs, Insomnium copies all your data once a day and keeps the last seven, so a deleted workspace or a bad import can be undone.": "运行期间，Insomnium 每天会复制一次你的所有数据，并保留最近七份，因此误删的工作区或错误的导入都可以撤销。",
  "Will restart the app": "将重新启动应用",
  "With full access, the plugin runs with Node.js, as Insomnium itself does: it can read and change any of your files, run programs, and send anything anywhere, including the requests, tokens and responses it sees.": "拥有完全访问权限时，插件会像 Insomnium 本身一样使用 Node.js 运行：它可以读取和修改你的任何文件、运行程序，并将任何内容发送到任何地方，包括它看到的请求、令牌和响应。",
  "With the proxy above off, go through the system's: the OS proxy settings (and PAC file), or the HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY and NO_PROXY environment variables. Off by default, so requests go direct.": "在上方代理关闭时，改用系统代理：操作系统的代理设置（及 PAC 文件），或 HTTP_PROXY、HTTPS_PROXY 和 NO_PROXY 环境变量。默认关闭，即请求直接发送。",
